# Q2 benchmarks. The per-point .jsonl records are kept: they are a few KB each and
# they are the primary evidence behind every number quoted in the report, including
# the per-phase detail the aggregated CSV drops. The E0 capability reports are kept
# for the same reason -- every later result depends on what E0 established the stack
# can measure. Anything else here is scratch.
q2_results/raw/*
!q2_results/raw/e0_preflight_*.json
!q2_results/raw/*.jsonl
